<title>USA: FSA qualifies six bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies six bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said Thursday it qualified six bond issues for insurance slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Evansville, Ind., $11.8 million of refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Clark County, Nev., School District $35 million of GOs and $5 million of GOs.</p>
<p>--Fillmore, N.Y., Central School District, $6.7 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Guilderland, N.Y., Central School District $6.4 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Glendale, Pa., School District $5 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--McLennan County, Texas, $10 million of certificates of obligation.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
